~C. The city has no roads.#The main road is mentioned. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~D. Citizens stopped using carts.#The passage does not say that. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

